sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cron as CRE Cron
    participant WF as Pending NAV Workflow
    participant NAV1 as Vault 1 Nav Automation
    participant NAV2 as Vault 2 Nav Automation
    participant Path as CRE Write Path

    Cron->>WF: Run every 5 minutes
    WF->>NAV1: checkUpkeep(0x)
    NAV1-->>WF: upkeepNeeded is true
    WF->>Path: Separate report for Vault 1
    Path-->>WF: Vault 1 write fails
    Note over WF,Path: Record failure and continue
    WF->>NAV2: checkUpkeep(0x)
    NAV2-->>WF: upkeepNeeded is true
    WF->>Path: Separate report for Vault 2
    Path-->>WF: Vault 2 write succeeds
    Note over Cron,WF: Next run retries only targets still ready
